    /// List the favorites of the seller's listings
    ///
    /// The favorites of the listings of every marketplace account of the seller. A favorite is a buyer of the marketplace who put one of the seller's listings in their favorites, named by their identifier on the marketplace (`buyerId`). Its `item` is a summary of the item of the listing, `null` when ControlResell does not follow the listing. The most recent first (by `createdAt`, then `id`), one page at a time: pass the `nextCursor` of a page as `cursor` to read the next one, with the same filters (a cursor reused with other filters is an `invalid_cursor`). `from` and `to` go straight to a period of the favorite's date: `from` is inclusive, `to` exclusive. An `accountId` or an `itemId` that is not the seller's answers an empty page. Requires `items:read`.
